---
import StarlightPage from "@astrojs/starlight/components/StarlightPage.astro";
import Playground from "../components/Playground.astro";
---

<StarlightPage
  frontmatter={{
    title: "Playground",
    description:
      "Try fakeborn in the browser — write a Zod or Valibot schema, run it in a sandboxed iframe, and see the fakes it generates.",
    tableOfContents: false,
  }}
  hasSidebar={false}
>
  <p>
    Write a schema, get fakes that satisfy it. The harness calls
    <code>fake(schema, {"{ count, seed, adapter }"})</code> for you — declare a top-level
    <code>schema</code> and use the toolbar to control the run. Everything executes locally in a
    sandboxed iframe; nothing leaves your browser.
  </p>
  <Playground />
</StarlightPage>
